@host = http://localhost:5135/api/stock

### Two batches of the same category
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 101, "category": "Shoes", "quantity": 3 }

###
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 102, "category": "Shoes", "quantity": 10 }

### Reserve 5: should take 3 from 101 and 2 from 102
POST {{host}}/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "category": "Shoes", "quantity": 5 }

### Check: 101 -> 0, 102 -> 8
GET {{host}}/batches

### All reservations of user 1
GET {{host}}/reservations?userId=1

### Not enough: 409, and batches must be unchanged afterwards
POST {{host}}/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "category": "Shoes", "quantity": 100 }

### Unknown user: 400
POST {{host}}/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 99999, "category": "Shoes", "quantity": 1 }

### Invalid quantity: 400 from validation
POST {{host}}/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "category": "Shoes", "quantity": 0 }

### Release: paste the id from the reserve response, 204, then 101 -> 3, 102 -> 10
POST {{host}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/release

### Release again: 409
POST {{host}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/release
